# Media types for the COPI artefacts served from this directory.
#
# Without these, Apache serves copi.owl / copi.ttl as application/octet-stream,
# and tools that parse the ontology from its IRI (FOOPS!, among others) cannot
# tell what format they received and give up. index.php also serves the RDF
# files itself with the right header, so content negotiation on the ontology
# IRI keeps working even where AllowOverride prevents this file from applying.

AddType application/rdf+xml .owl .rdf
AddType text/turtle .ttl
AddType application/n-triples .nt
AddType application/ld+json .jsonld
AddType text/csv .csv

AddCharset UTF-8 .ttl .nt
